  'Live and read back: migration_runs ok for the nine migrations above (18:21Z to 20:13Z); qnfo-ops 2.59.2 (tool miss is not a failure, web_search q alias) and 2.59.5 (issue tools take owner and repo) and qnfo-fleet-control 0.56.2 (objectiveConstraintsTick reads the contract before it closes; objective_constraint_runs 20:01Z shows 0.56.2 and close_deferred 0) through canonical-deploy; fleet_tasks metric-refresh gained four steps (attributed-share, probation-sample-gate, awaiting-samples, breaches-unmapped; the 20:01Z run executed 15 steps ok and read breaches_unmapped 8 where the stored value had said 0 for ten hours) and management-personas gained rc-probe; metrics attributed_runtime_verified_share_24h, orphan_verification_rows_24h and metrics_awaiting_samples registered. 7 file work claims for merged migrations have no stored token and lapse by TTL (the last at 21:06Z).',
